content.text:
I am setting up your Settings user interface on the **main** surface. This will include tabs for managing your profile and notification settings, along with a secure modal prompt for account deletion.

First, let's initialize the UI surface with the basic components catalog and a red brand style suited for critical settings actions.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "main",
    "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json",
    "theme": {
      "primaryColor": "#D32F2F",
      "agentDisplayName": "Account Settings"
    }
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

Next, let's define and organize the components to construct the settings interface. The interface consists of:
- A header title.
- A **Tabs** component containing:
  - A **Profile** tab with a text input field for the user's name.
  - A **# Notifications** tab with a toggle checkbox to enable email notifications.
- A divider separation line.
- A **Modal** with a "Delete Account" button trigger, which displays a confirmation prompt and destructive action confirmation buttons when clicked.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "main",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "headerText",
          "settingsTabs",
          "divider",
          "deleteAccountModal"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "headerText",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "User Settings",
        "variant": "h1"
      },
      {
        "id": "settingsTabs",
        "component": "Tabs",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "title": "Profile",
            "child": "profileCol"
          },
          {
            "title": "# Notifications",
            "child": "notificationsCol"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "divider",
        "component": "Divider",
        "axis": "horizontal"
      },
      {
        "id": "deleteAccountModal",
        "component": "Modal",
        "trigger": "deleteAccountBtn",
        "content": "deleteAccountConfirmCol"
      },
      {
        "id": "profileCol",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "profileNameField"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "profileNameField",
        "component": "TextField",
        "label": "Name",
        "value": {
          "path": "/profile/name"
        },
        "variant": "shortText"
      },
      {
        "id": "notificationsCol",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "emailNotificationsCheck"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "emailNotificationsCheck",
        "component": "CheckBox",
        "label": "Enable email notifications",
        "value": {
          "path": "/notifications/emailEnabled"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "deleteAccountBtn",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "deleteAccountBtnText",
        "variant": "primary",
        "action": {
          "event": {
            "name": "OPEN_DELETE_CONFIRMATION"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "deleteAccountBtnText",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Delete Account"
      },
      {
        "id": "deleteAccountConfirmCol",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "confirmText",
          "confirmButtonsRow"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "confirmText",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Are you sure you want to delete your account? This action cannot be undone.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "confirmButtonsRow",
        "component": "Row",
        "children": [
          "confirmDeleteBtn",
          "cancelDeleteBtn"
        ],
        "align": "center",
        "justify": "end"
      },
      {
        "id": "confirmDeleteBtn",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "confirmDeleteBtnText",
        "variant": "primary",
        "action": {
          "event": {
            "name": "CONFIRM_DELETE_ACCOUNT"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "confirmDeleteBtnText",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Confirm Deletion"
      },
      {
        "id": "cancelDeleteBtn",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "cancelDeleteBtnText",
        "variant": "default",
        "action": {
          "event": {
            "name": "CANCEL_DELETE_ACCOUNT"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cancelDeleteBtnText",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Cancel"
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

The layout has been successfully built on your settings page! You can now switch between the tabs and try opening the confirmation dialog by clicking the "Delete Account" button.

