content.text:
Here is the dynamic customer feedback survey form. I've designed it to stream straight to your UI using the standard components for choice selection, text input, and submission.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "main",
      "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

Next, we establish the layout and populate it with the heading, rating selection, feature likes list, optional comments, and the submit action button.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "main",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "titleText",
            "ratingPicker",
            "likesPicker",
            "commentsField",
            "submitButton"
          ],
          "align": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "id": "titleText",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "# Customer Feedback",
          "variant": "h2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ratingPicker",
          "component": "ChoicePicker",
          "label": "How would you rate our service?",
          "variant": "mutuallyExclusive",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Excellent",
              "value": "excellent"
            },
            {
              "label": "Good",
              "value": "good"
            },
            {
              "label": "Average",
              "value": "average"
            },
            {
              "label": "Poor",
              "value": "poor"
            }
          ],
          "value": {
            "path": "/feedback/rating"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "likesPicker",
          "component": "ChoicePicker",
          "label": "What did you like?",
          "variant": "multipleSelection",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Product Quality",
              "value": "product_quality"
            },
            {
              "label": "Price",
              "value": "price"
            },
            {
              "label": "Customer Support",
              "value": "customer_support"
            }
          ],
          "value": {
            "path": "/feedback/likes"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "commentsField",
          "component": "TextField",
          "label": "Any other comments?",
          "variant": "longText",
          "value": {
            "path": "/feedback/comments"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "submitButton",
          "component": "Button",
          "child": "submitButtonText",
          "variant": "primary",
          "action": {
