I am happy to help you create a contact card. I will now initialize the surface and construct the user interface according to your requirements.

First, I will create the surface:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "main",
    "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

Next, I will send the component updates. The UI features a root `Card` containing a `Column` layout. This column coordinates the top `Row` (housing Jane's avatar and contact details) and the `Button` at the bottom.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "main",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "Card",
        "child": "main-layout"
      },
      {
        "id": "main-layout",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "contact-row",
          "map-button"
        ],
        "align": "stretch"
      },
      {
        "id": "contact-row",
        "component": "Row",
        "children": [
          "avatar",
          "info-column"
        ],
        "align": "center"
      },
      {
        "id": "map-button",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "button-text",
        "variant": "primary",
        "action": {
          "functionCall": {
            "call": "openUrl",
            "args": {
              "url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=Jane+Doe"
            },
            "returnType": "void"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "button-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "View on Map"
      },
      {
        "id": "avatar",
        "component": "Image",
        "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&h=150",
        "description": "Jane Doe's Profile Image",
        "variant": "avatar"
      },
      {
        "id": "info-column",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "name-text",
          "email-text",
          "phone-text"
        ],
        "align": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "name-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Jane Doe",
        "variant": "h3"
      },
      {
        "id": "email-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "jane.doe@example.com",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "phone-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "(123) 456-7890",
        "variant": "caption"
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

