        "text": "Step out in absolute style and comfort. This premium leather jacket is tailored from genuine, durable leather with heavy-duty metal zippers, custom internal lining, and utility pockets. Designed to withstand the elements while preserving a sleek silhouette.",
        "variant": "body"
