Here is the interactive restaurant menu layout for Gourmet Bistro, organized into clean, easy-to-read tabs for Starters, Mains, and Desserts.

First, let's establish the interface surface.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "main",
    "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json",
    "theme": {
      "primaryColor": "#D2691E",
      "agentDisplayName": "Gourmet Bistro Menu"
    }
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

Now, we'll populate the surface with the menu header, tab navigation, and listed items.

