      },
      {
        "id": "desc_3",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Located in Midtown East. A glamorous, high-end destination serving elevated Northern Chinese dishes and artful dim sum in a stunning setting.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "desc_4",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Located in Midtown West. The massive and incredibly popular flagship of the globally-beloved Taiwanese soup dumpling specialists.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "desc_5",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Located in SoHo. Comfort food meets elegance, blending meticulously prepared soup dumplings with an exceptional curated natural wine menu.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "desc_6",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Located in Midtown. A stellar casual option renowned for its intensely spicy hand-pulled Biang Biang noodles and cumin lamb burgers.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "desc_7",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Located in Midtown. Michelin-recognized restaurant featuring authentic Szechuan classics in a gorgeous, retro-chic 1930s Shanghai-style lounge.",
