Here is a test configuration interface designed to let you review and execute tests against your **custom catalog**, **role description**, and **workflow description** settings.

The response below contains two UI messaging blocks:
1. **Create Surface Message**: Sets up the diagnostic container with a specific identifier and theme colors.
2. **Update Components Message**: Builds the visual elements, including inputs for the catalog ID, role, and workflow descriptions, followed by a primary action button to run the configurations.

### 1. Initialize the Surface

First, we create a rendering workspace for the testing dashboard:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "system-test-workspace",
    "catalogId": "com.example.testing:custom-catalog",
    "theme": {
      "primaryColor": "#6366F1",
      "agentDisplayName": "Configuration Tester Agent"
    },
    "sendDataModel": true
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### 2. Render the Test Dashboard

Next, we establish the layout tree, ensuring top-down ordering of the parent/child component definitions:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "system-test-workspace",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "header-row",
          "divider-line",
          "body-card",
          "footer-row"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "header-row",
        "component": "Row",
        "children": [
          "header-icon",
          "header-title"
        ],
        "align": "center",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "header-icon",
        "component": "Icon",
        "name": "settings"
      },
      {
        "id": "header-title",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "Agent Integration Diagnostic Panel",
        "variant": "h3"
      },
      {
        "id": "divider-line",
        "component": "Divider",
        "axis": "horizontal"
      },
      {
        "id": "body-card",
        "component": "Card",
        "child": "form-col"
      },
      {
        "id": "form-col",
        "component": "Column",
        "children": [
          "catalog-input",
          "role-input",
          "workflow-input"
        ],
        "align": "stretch",
        "justify": "start"
      },
      {
        "id": "catalog-input",
        "component": "TextField",
        "label": "Custom Catalog ID (catalogId)",
        "value": "com.example.testing:custom-catalog",
        "variant": "shortText"
      },
      {
        "id": "role-input",
        "component": "TextField",
        "label": "Agent Role Description",
        "value": "You are a custom AI assistant designed to test and validate workflows, interface definitions, and catalog metadata.",
        "variant": "longText"
      },
      {
        "id": "workflow-input",
        "component": "TextField",
        "label": "Agent Workflow Description",
        "value": "1. Render interface\n2. Gather setup validation rules\n3. Execute integration endpoints\n4. Report diagnostics results",
        "variant": "longText"
      },
      {
        "id": "footer-row",
        "component": "Row",
        "children": [
          "run-btn"
        ],
        "align": "center",
        "justify": "end"
      },
      {
        "id": "run-btn",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "run-btn-text",
        "variant": "primary",
        "action": {
          "event": {
            "name": "run-diagnostics",
            "context": {
              "targetCatalog": "com.example.testing:custom-catalog"
